      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Munnsville%2C_New_York",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "New York State Route 46, known locally as Main Street, cuts through the village and links it to Oneida 8 miles north.",
